「入口」乃化「有」为「有」者也。
「入口」者得「无」而
　令「文档」为「析篇」于『<html><body><div id="a"></div></body></html>』而
　令「境」为「急就新全局境」于「元」而
　令「绑定」为「系网览篇」于「境」于「文档」而
　令「无」为「装内容安全事」于「境」而
　令「成」为
　　「急就在境行脚本」
　　　于「境」
　　　于『var e = new SecurityPolicyViolationEvent("securitypolicyviolation", {documentURI:"https://a.example/page", referrer:"https://r.example/", blockedURI:"https://b.example/x.js", violatedDirective:"script-src", effectiveDirective:"script-src", originalPolicy:"script-src 'self'", sourceFile:"a.js", sample:"<script>", disposition:"enforce", statusCode:200, lineNumber:3, columnNumber:4});var ok1 = e.violatedDirective === "script-src" && e.blockedURI === "https://b.example/x.js" && e.lineNumber === 3 && e.columnNumber === 4 && e.statusCode === 200 && e.sample === "<script>" && e.disposition === "enforce";var d = new SecurityPolicyViolationEvent("securitypolicyviolation");var ok2 = d.violatedDirective === "" && d.lineNumber === 0 && d.disposition === "enforce" && d.documentURI === "" && d.referrer === "";var ok3 = false;try { new SecurityPolicyViolationEvent(); } catch (err) { ok3 = err instanceof TypeError; }var ok4 = new SecurityPolicyViolationEvent("securitypolicyviolation") !== undefined;(ok1 && ok2 && ok3 && ok4);』而
